cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the paper and this archive."
title: "SMMRT-DMET-ST-data: data archive for ab initio spin-phonon relaxation of single-ion magnets"
abstract: "Raw and processed data for the three compounds (DyAC, DybBr, DyCp) and the spatial-truncation study of the manuscript 'Accelerating ab initio spin-phonon relaxation simulation of single-ion magnets by quantum embedding and spatial truncation': crystal-field parameters, spin-phonon coupling matrices, master-equation matrices, tau(T) data, phonons, structures, figures and the scripts as used at run time."
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ccme-tmc/SMMRT-DMET-ST-data"
url: "https://github.com/ccme-tmc/SMMRT-DMET-ST-data"
keywords:
  - single-ion magnets
  - spin-phonon coupling
  - density matrix embedding theory
  - CASSCF
  - spatial truncation
  - magnetic relaxation
  - Dy(III) complexes
authors:
